sparky-stereo-colour-vision (0.1.1) mashtabba; urgency=medium

  * The red-cyan sentence says what each kind of colour vision sees, without ranking the outputs: for protan and deutan
    the depth stays and fewer colours stay apart, a 3D television or another 3D output keeps every colour; for
    monochromacy the depth is as for anyone and the colours play no part; for tritan no sentence (queue row 68)
  * The variants keep their texts at 4.5:1 in unfocused windows too, with KColorScheme's own inactive rules; the
    shipped variants and the measured close pairs are made again from the edition's fixed looks (queue row 68)

